  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syunik Women Entrepreneurship Incubation Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Syunik Women Entrepreneurship Incubation Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Hub Yerevan Social Innovation Development Foundation has opened Impact Hug Syunik to provide support strengthen entrepreunial opportunities in Syunik by re-skilling vulnerable and displaced people, spefically women with project Syunik Women Entrepreneurship Incubation Program. Program will actively support local entrepreneurs and people with entrepreneurial ideas, capacity building and providing knowledge and exprerience.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">PYM-hanke Armeniassa 2022 - 2023. Impact Hub Armenia Social Innovation Development Foundation aloittaa hankkeen Syunik Women Entrepreneurship Incubation Program Armeniassa Syunikin rajaseudulla. Alueella on paljon sodan takia alueelle muuttaneita haavoittuvassa asemassa olevia henkil&#xF6;it&#xE4; ja hankkeen tavoitteena erityisesti naisten yritt&#xE4;jyyden tukeminen uudelleen koulutuksen ja yritysilmapiirin vahvistamisen avulla.</narrative>
  </description>
